# The appliance integration branch intentionally tracks package-lock.json and
# the production dist/ bundle. Yocto 6.0 does not fetch NPM dependencies during
# BitBake tasks; the pinned Git revision is therefore a self-contained,
# reproducible source input for the appliance recipe.
